{"n": 1203, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "1203.webp", "text": "64-7\n\n6411 205 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\n\nHEATER\n\nRemove dashboard trim panel - see\n\n51 45 030.\n\nDon't discharge retrigerant outdoors,\nbut Instead draw It out of system —\nrefer to operating Instructions supplied\nwith equipment.\n\nInstallation:\nDischarge, charge and check air condi-\ntloner for leaks after Installation.\n\nDisconnect battery ground lead.\nPull off rubber strip (1).\n\nCut off wire straps (2).\n\nUnscrew bolts (3).\n\nPlace cover (4) aside.\n\nDrain coolant.\nDisconnect both water hoses.\n\nInstallation:\nBleed cooling system.\nCheck coolant.\n\nDisconnect plugs (1) connecting heater\nwire harness and car wire harness.\n\n30 64 151\n\nUnscrew nut (1) and bolt (2).\nTake off bracket (3).\n\nInstallation\nCheck rubber mount (4), replacing if\nnecessary.\n\nOnly for Cars with Air Conditioner\nUnscrew pipes (1 and 2).\n\nInsert plugs (3) in open connections\nimmediately.\n\nCounterhold on block valve (4) with\nwrench (5).\n\ninstallation\nTightening torque’.\nReplace seals.\n\nRemove connector (1) between heater\n(3) and rear area heater duct (2) on left\nand right sides.\n\n* See Specifications", "words": [["64-7", 0.464, 0.0245, 0.5228, 0.0477], ["6411", 0.2736, 0.0849, 0.2999, 0.0955], ["205", 0.306, 0.0849, 0.3242, 0.0962], ["REMOVING", 0.3318, 0.0849, 0.3911, 0.0962], ["AND", 0.3961, 0.0855, 0.4195, 0.0962], ["INSTALLING", 0.4235, 0.0849, 0.4894, 0.0968], ["HEATER", 0.3313, 0.1015, 0.3764, 0.1127], ["Remove", 0.2736, 0.134, 0.3166, 0.1452], ["dashboard", 0.3212, 0.1346, 0.3769, 0.1459], ["trim", 0.3815, 0.1346, 0.4012, 0.1459], ["panel", 0.4063, 0.1353, 0.4336, 0.1485], ["-", 0.4382, 0.1406, 0.4438, 0.1432], ["see", 0.4478, 0.1373, 0.4661, 0.1459], ["51", 0.2736, 0.1505, 0.2837, 0.1618], ["45", 0.2888, 0.1505, 0.3009, 0.1618], ["030.", 0.305, 0.1505, 0.3267, 0.1618], ["Don't", 0.2736, 0.1671, 0.3014, 0.1784], ["discharge", 0.306, 0.1671, 0.3576, 0.1817], ["retrigerant", 0.3617